==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**23,700 grants +3 Bricks Z.
**23,800 grants +3 Feathers Z.
**23,900 grants +3 Coal Z.
*Expanded on [[Stage Difficulties]]:
**Added star difficulties to [[Main Chapters Levels]], [[Catclaw Dojo]] (including [[Ranking Dojo]]) and [[Underground Labyrinth]].
**Stages' star difficulties are now shown above the Enemies Appearing window and on Main Chapters' menu buttons.
**Stars will turn pink after clearing their corresponding [[Catclaw Championships]] stage.
*Changed [[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Master of Life Dr. Nova]]'s minimum spawn layer from 5 to 0 so they will be layered behind most other characters. This also applies to their Evolved Form.
*Added a button to show recommendations for units to upgrade in the [[Upgrade Menu]] for players below 1,600 User Rank.

